 <h3><u>Duniya mein haider dusra</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Dhoond ne nikle the jo duniya mein Haider doosra</p> 
  <p>Mill nahi paaya unhe ab tak Qalandar doosra</p> 
  <p>1. Hai kahaan Jibreel jo Rizwaan laaya hai libaas<br> Kya Ali ne rakh liya hai ghar mein naukar doosra</p> 
  <p>2. Hum tumhe dikhlaaenge Yusuf Ali ki aal mein<br> Tum na dikhla paaoge Nabiyo'n mein Akbar doosra</p> 
  <p>3. Jab Nabi kehte the Khaiber mein lade jaa kar koi<br> Dekhta tha ek ko fauran palatkar doosra</p> 
  <p>4. Iss ko maara hai Ali ne ye Ali ka kaam hai<br> Deklo hai pehle hisse ke baraabar doosra</p> 
  <p>5. Tegho'n ke saaye mein sona bus Ali ka kaam hai<br> Bhaag hi jaata agar hota waha'n par doosra</p> 
  <p>6. Aam darwaaze se jaae'n kyu khawaas-e-Kibriya<br> Hoga Kaabe mein Ali ke vaaste dar doosra</p> 
  <p>7. Le to aaye hai saqeefa waale rehbar doosra<br> Laayenge lekin kahaa'n se khum ka mimbar doosra</p> 
  <p>8. Keh rahi hai ye adaae'n Asghar-e-besheer ki<br> Chahiye in mutthiyo'n ko baab-e-Khaiber doosra</p> 
  <p></p> 
